"¿O queres gardar?"

#: kiconedit.cpp:253
msgid "New &Window"
msgstr "Nova &fiestra"

#: kiconedit.cpp:256
msgid ""
"New window\n"
"\n"
"Opens a new icon editor window."
msgstr ""
"Nova fiestra\n"
"\n"
"Abrirase unha nova fiestra de edición."

#: kiconedit.cpp:259
msgid ""
"New\n"
"\n"
"Create a new icon, either from a template or by specifying the size"
msgstr ""
"Nova\n"
"\n"
"Crear unha nova icona, dende un modelo ou especificando o tamaño"

#: kiconedit.cpp:263
msgid ""
"Open\n"
"\n"
"Open an existing icon"
msgstr ""
"Abrir\n"
"\n"
"Abrir unha icona que xa existe"

#: kiconedit.cpp:271
msgid ""
"Save\n"
"\n"
"Save the current icon"
msgstr ""
"Gravar\n"
"\n"
"Gravar a icona actual"

#: kiconedit.cpp:276
msgid ""
"Print\n"
"\n"
"Opens a print dialog to let you print the current icon."
msgstr ""
"Imprimir\n"
"\n"
"Abrir un diálogo de impresión para imprimir a icona actual."

#: kiconedit.cpp:284
msgid ""
"Cut\n"
"\n"
"Cut the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Cortar\n"
"\n"
"Cortar a selección actual da icona\n"
"\n"
"(Consello: podes facer seleccións rectangulares e circulares)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:288
msgid ""
"Copy\n"
"\n"
"Copy the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Copiar\n"
"\n"
"Copiar a selección actual da icona\n"
"\n"
"(Consello: podes facer seleccións rectangulares e circulares)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:292
msgid ""
"Paste\n"
"\n"
"Paste the contents of the clipboard into the current icon.\n"
"\n"
"If the contents are larger than the current icon you can paste them in a new "
"window.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Select \"Paste transparent pixels\" in the configuration dialog if you "
"also want to paste transparency.)"
msgstr ""
"Pegar\n"
"\n"
"Pega o contido do portaretallos na icona actual.\n"
"\n"
"Se o contido é maior ca icona actual, o podes pegar nunha nova fiestra\n"
"\n"
"(Consello: selecciona «Pegar pixeles transparentes» no diálogo de "
"configuración se queres pegar a transparencia.)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:300
msgid "Paste as &New"
msgstr "Pegar como &novo"

#: kiconedit.cpp:309
msgid "Resi&ze..."
msgstr "Red&imensionar..."

#: kiconedit.cpp:312
msgid ""
"Resize\n"
"\n"
"Smoothly resizes the icon while trying to preserve the contents"
msgstr ""
"Redimensionar\n"
"\n"
"Redimensión suave da icona procurando manter os contidos."

#: kiconedit.cpp:317
msgid "&GrayScale"
msgstr "Escala de &grises"

#: kiconedit.cpp:320
msgid ""
"Gray scale\n"
"\n"
"Gray scale the current icon.\n"
"(Warning: The result is likely to contain colors not in the icon palette"
msgstr ""
"Escala de grises\n"
"\n"
"Convertir a escala de grises a icona actual.\n"
"(Advertencia: e pobable que o resultado conteña cores que non estén na "
"paleta)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:327
msgid ""
"Zoom in\n"
"\n"
"Zoom in by one."
msgstr ""
"Acercar\n"
"\n"
"Ampliar o zoom."

#: kiconedit.cpp:331
msgid ""
"Zoom out\n"
"\n"
"Zoom out by one."
msgstr ""
"Alonxar\n"
"\n"
"Diminuir o zoom."

#: kiconedit.cpp:335
msgid "&Zoom"
msgstr ""

#: kiconedit.cpp:339
msgid "100%"
msgstr "100%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:345
msgid "200%"
msgstr "200%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:351
msgid "500%"
msgstr "500%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:357
msgid "1000%"
msgstr "1000%"

#: kiconedit.cpp:377
msgid "Show &Grid"
msgstr "Amosar &enreixado"

#: kiconedit.cpp:380
msgid "Hide &Grid"
msgstr "Agochar &enreixado"

#: kiconedit.cpp:381
msgid ""
"Show grid\n"
"\n"
"Toggles the grid in the icon edit grid on/off"
msgstr ""
"Amosar enreixado\n"
"\n"
"Activa/desactiva o enreixado"

#: kiconedit.cpp:388
msgid "Color Picker"
msgstr "Selección da cor"

#: kiconedit.cpp:392
msgid ""
"Color Picker\n"
"\n"
"The color of the pixel clicked on will be the current draw color"
msgstr ""
"Selección da cor\n"
"\n"
"A cor do punto pulsado será a cor de debuxo"

#: kiconedit.cpp:397
msgid "Freehand"
msgstr "Man alzada"

#: kiconedit.cpp:401
msgid ""
"Free hand\n"
"\n"
"Draw non-linear lines"
msgstr ""
"Man alzada\n"
"\n"
"Debuxar a man alzada"

#: kiconedit.cpp:408
msgid "Rectangle"
msgstr "Rectángulo"

#: kiconedit.cpp:412
msgid ""
"Rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a rectangle"
msgstr ""
"Rectángulo\n"
"\n"
"Debuxar un rectángulo"

#: kiconedit.cpp:416
msgid "Filled Rectangle"
msgstr "Rectángulo recheo"

#: kiconedit.cpp:420
msgid ""
"Filled rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled rectangle"
msgstr ""
"Rectángulo recheo\n"
"\n"
"Debuxar un rectángulo recheo"

#: kiconedit.cpp:424
msgid "Circle"
msgstr "Círculo"

#: kiconedit.cpp:428
msgid ""
"Circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a circle"
msgstr ""
"Círculo\n"
"\n"
"Debuxar un círculo"

#: kiconedit.cpp:432
msgid "Filled Circle"
msgstr "Círculo recheo"

#: kiconedit.cpp:436
msgid ""
"Filled circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled circle"
msgstr ""
"Círculo recheo\n"
"\n"
"Debuxar un círculo recheo"

#: kiconedit.cpp:440
msgid "Ellipse"
msgstr "Elipse"

#: kiconedit.cpp:444
msgid ""
"Ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw an ellipse"
msgstr ""
"Elipse\n"
"\n"
"Debuxar unha elipse"

#: kiconedit.cpp:448
msgid "Filled Ellipse"
msgstr "Elipse rechea"

#: kiconedit.cpp:452
msgid ""
"Filled ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled ellipse"
msgstr ""
"Elipse rechea\n"
"\n"
"Debuxar unha elipse rechea"

#: kiconedit.cpp:456
msgid "Spray"
msgstr "Aerógrafo"

#: kiconedit.cpp:460
msgid ""
"Spray\n"
"\n"
"Draw scattered pixels in the current color"
msgstr ""
"Aerógrafo\n"
"\n"
"Debuxa puntos dispersos coa cor actual"

#: kiconedit.cpp:465
msgid "Flood Fill"
msgstr "Encher de cor"

#: kiconedit.cpp:469
msgid ""
"Flood fill\n"
"\n"
"Fill adjoining pixels with the same color with the current color"
msgstr ""
"Encher de cor\n"
"\n"
"Encher os puntos contiguos de igual cor coa cor actual"

#: kiconedit.cpp:474
msgid "Line"
msgstr "Liña"

#: kiconedit.cpp:478
msgid ""
"Line\n"
"\n"
"Draw a straight line vertically, horizontally or at 45 deg. angles"
msgstr ""
"Liña\n"
"\n"
"Debuxar unha liña recta vertical, horizontal ou cun ángulo de 45 grados"

#: kiconedit.cpp:483
msgid "Eraser (Transparent)"
msgstr "Goma (trasparente)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:487
msgid ""
"Erase\n"
"\n"
"Erase pixels. Set the pixels to be transparent\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: If you want to draw transparency with a different tool, first click on "
"\"Erase\" then on the tool you want to use)"
msgstr ""
"Goma\n"
"\n"
"Borra puntos. Sinalar os puntos que serán transparentes\n"
"\n"
"(Consello: se buscas debuxar transparencias con outra ferramenta, preme "
"primeiro en «Borrar» e logo elixe a ferramente que queres empregar)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:494
msgid "Rectangular Selection"
msgstr "Selección rectangular"

#: kiconedit.cpp:498
msgid ""
"Select\n"
"\n"
"Select a rectangular section of the icon using the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Selección\n"
"\n"
"Elexir unha selección rectangular na icona empregando o rato."

#: kiconedit.cpp:503
msgid "Circular Selection"
msgstr "Selección circular"

#: kiconedit.cpp:507
msgid ""
"Select\n"
"\n"
"Select a circular section of the icon using the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Selección\n"
"\n"
"Elexir unha selección circular na icona empregando o rato."

#: kiconedit.cpp:535
msgid ""
"Statusbar\n"
"\n"
"The statusbar gives information on the status of the current icon. The "
"fields are:\n"
"\n"
"\t- Application messages\n"
"\t- Cursor position\n"
"\t- Size\n"
"\t- Zoom factor\n"
"\t- Number of colors"
msgstr ""
"Barra de estado\n"
"\n"
"A barra de estado mostra información sobre o estado da icona actual. Os "
"campos son:\n"
"\n"
"\t- Mensaxes da aplicación\n"
"\t- Posición do cursor\n"
"\t- Tamaño\n"
"\t- Factor de amplación\n"
"\t- Número de cores"

